And you're a sneaky, sneaky spy,
Mr. Victor.


01:04:25.836 --> 01:04:27.303
How many cameras do you have?


01:04:27.471 --> 01:04:30.201
Enough to know your accent's
faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:30.374 --> 01:04:33.832
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:34.011 --> 01:04:35.342
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:35.512 --> 01:04:40.211
And he found a loophole that allows me
to access that money your daddy left you...


01:04:40.384 --> 01:04:42.944
...should I need it for a medical reason.


01:04:43.120 --> 01:04:45.987
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:46.156 --> 01:04:49.819
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:50.293 --> 01:04:52.318
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:04:52.496 --> 01:04:54.361
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:04:54.531 --> 01:04:56.089
Hold the tonic.


01:05:05.809 --> 01:05:07.800
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:07.978 --> 01:05:09.502
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:09.680 --> 01:05:11.511
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:12.182 --> 01:05:14.548
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:14.718 --> 01:05:17.744
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:17.921 --> 01:05:19.252
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:19.423 --> 01:05:21.254
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:21.425 --> 01:05:24.826
Have you, uh, released your mind
from the shackles of thinking today?


01:05:24.995 --> 01:05:26.895
- I'm working on it.
- Very good.


01:05:27.164 --> 01:05:29.894
- How was your meditation?
I hate you.


01:05:30.267 --> 01:05:32.531
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:32.703 --> 01:05:34.398
I know.


01:05:36.073 --> 01:05:38.906
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:39.076 --> 01:05:40.737
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:40.911 --> 01:05:43.744
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:43.914 --> 01:05:45.006
Are you an idiot?


01:05:45.182 --> 01:05:47.343
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:47.517 --> 01:05:49.382
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:49.553 --> 01:05:51.953
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:05:52.122 --> 01:05:54.317
You're annoying and ugly...


01:05:54.491 --> 01:05:55.890
...but I sort of love you.


01:05:58.328 --> 01:05:59.955
I sort of love you too.


01:06:00.564 --> 01:06:05.024
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:05.502 --> 01:06:07.094
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:07.270 --> 01:06:09.204
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:09.372 --> 01:06:10.862
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:11.775 --> 01:06:13.106
Okay.


01:06:13.376 --> 01:06:17.779
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:33.296 --> 01:06:36.925
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:37.200 --> 01:06:39.361
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:39.536 --> 01:06:41.629
Oh, okay.


01:06:41.805 --> 01:06:44.330
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:45.242 --> 01:06:49.144
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:50.113 --> 01:06:54.015
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:06:54.184 --> 01:06:56.709
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:06:56.887 --> 01:06:58.787
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:00.257 --> 01:07:04.694
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:06.563 --> 01:07:08.656
I don't know.


01:07:08.999 --> 01:07:11.263
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:11.434 --> 01:07:12.526
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:12.702 --> 01:07:15.170
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:15.338 --> 01:07:16.703
He'll say something like:


01:07:16.873 --> 01:07:19.808
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:19.976 --> 01:07:23.207
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:23.380 --> 01:07:26.611
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:28.451 --> 01:07:32.319
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:32.489 --> 01:07:34.184
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:34.357 --> 01:07:36.655
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:36.827 --> 01:07:39.887
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:41.464 --> 01:07:44.297
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:45.101 --> 01:07:46.568
You have talent.


01:07:46.736 --> 01:07:50.228
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:50.473 --> 01:07:52.805
This is, like, my only chance.


01:07:53.510 --> 01:07:55.239
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:07:55.412 --> 01:07:57.346
Just look at Mom.


01:07:59.516 --> 01:08:00.642
You think I'm talented?


01:08:02.452 --> 01:08:04.545
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:06.256 --> 01:08:07.780
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:07.958 --> 01:08:09.926
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:13.029 --> 01:08:14.257
This better work.


01:08:14.831 --> 01:08:17.061
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:30.046 --> 01:08:33.709
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:33.884 --> 01:08:36.978
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:37.153 --> 01:08:41.146
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:41.324 --> 01:08:43.815
