spinning tonight.


01:08:58.975 --> 01:09:05.039
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:14.791 --> 01:09:18.557
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:18.728 --> 01:09:21.822
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:21.998 --> 01:09:25.490
