01:11:26.189 --> 01:11:30.717
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:36.566 --> 01:11:37.590
Scratch that.


01:11:37.767 --> 01:11:40.702
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:49.412 --> 01:11:51.880
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:52.048 --> 01:11:55.950
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:11:58.755 --> 01:12:00.120
Move it. Guy.


01:12:00.290 --> 01:12:04.488
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:04.661 --> 01:12:06.128
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:06.296 --> 01:12:09.163
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:10.600 --> 01:12:11.794
Well, it had better be.


01:12:11.968 --> 01:12:13.196
I have to pee.


01:12:13.369 --> 01:12:16.600
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:19.542 --> 01:12:21.373
Sorry.


01:12:21.811 --> 01:12:24.336
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:24.514 --> 01:12:29.451
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:30.186 --> 01:12:32.347
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:32.522 --> 01:12:35.582
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:35.758 --> 01:12:38.124
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:38.294 --> 01:12:41.627
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:46.436 --> 01:12:47.767
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:47.937 --> 01:12:49.336
Okay.


01:12:49.672 --> 01:12:51.833
You guys having a good time?


01:12:52.408 --> 01:12:56.811
