01:13:50.934 --> 01:13:54.631
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:13:54.804 --> 01:13:59.207
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:59.375 --> 01:14:00.842
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:04.714 --> 01:14:05.738
Give me...


01:14:12.422 --> 01:14:16.518
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:16.926 --> 01:14:19.417
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:22.298 --> 01:14:24.425
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:29.639 --> 01:14:33.871
How dare you sabotage your mother,
