01:15:51.220 --> 01:15:52.244
<i>If you want it</i>


01:15:52.422 --> 01:15:54.549
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:15:54.724 --> 01:15:56.021
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:15:56.192 --> 01:15:58.456
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:15:58.628 --> 01:15:59.652
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:15:59.829 --> 01:16:01.797
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:01.964 --> 01:16:03.761
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:03.933 --> 01:16:08.393
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:08.571 --> 01:16:11.335
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:11.507 --> 01:16:15.170
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:15.345 --> 01:16:18.974
