01:16:28.057 --> 01:16:30.525
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:30.693 --> 01:16:34.595
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:34.764 --> 01:16:36.857
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:43.306 --> 01:16:45.103
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:46.943 --> 01:16:49.434
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:16:52.582 --> 01:16:54.982
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:16:58.287 --> 01:16:59.652
Hey. Clear.


01:17:02.759 --> 01:17:05.159
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:05.328 --> 01:17:06.625
Like what?


01:17:06.896 --> 01:17:08.761
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:08.931 --> 01:17:10.728
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:10.900 --> 01:17:16.270
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:19.041 --> 01:17:21.009
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:28.718 --> 01:17:32.711
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:35.825 --> 01:17:40.455
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:41.697 --> 01:17:45.258
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:45.435 --> 01:17:46.925
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:48.905 --> 01:17:52.341
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:17:52.508 --> 01:17:55.671
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:17:55.845 --> 01:17:58.780
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:17:58.948 --> 01:18:00.575
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:00.750 --> 01:18:06.484
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:06.656 --> 01:18:09.955
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:10.126 --> 01:18:13.095
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:13.262 --> 01:18:16.459
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:16.632 --> 01:18:19.032
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:19.202 --> 01:18:22.330
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:23.806 --> 01:18:30.678
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:30.847 --> 01:18:34.510
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:34.684 --> 01:18:41.681
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:41.858 --> 01:18:45.123
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:45.294 --> 01:18:48.195
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:48.364 --> 01:18:55.793
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:55.972 --> 01:18:59.169
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:59.342 --> 01:19:02.311
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:02.478 --> 01:19:05.572
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:05.748 --> 01:19:08.239
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:08.417 --> 01:19:11.147
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:28.671 --> 01:19:30.332
