the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:03.506 --> 01:20:05.269
Oh. Which album?


01:20:06.175 --> 01:20:07.199
Your album.


01:20:08.878 --> 01:20:10.869
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:12.481 --> 01:20:14.949
