- Uh-huh.


01:20:17.186 --> 01:20:18.517
Go for it.


01:20:18.688 --> 01:20:21.452
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:21.624 --> 01:20:23.683
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:23.859 --> 01:20:25.656
You know, I sing too.


01:20:25.828 --> 01:20:29.457
