How dare you? Teaching is my life.


01:21:09.939 --> 01:21:11.873
Give it up, Mom.


01:21:14.076 --> 01:21:15.543
Guy!


01:21:16.879 --> 01:21:20.542
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:20.783 --> 01:21:24.549
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:26.022 --> 01:21:29.082
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:29.258 --> 01:21:31.852
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:32.028 --> 01:21:33.586
Let's try this again.


01:21:33.796 --> 01:21:35.661
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:37.233 --> 01:21:39.963
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:05.628 --> 01:22:07.858
Hey. Clear.


01:22:23.546 --> 01:22:25.707
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:25.881 --> 01:22:28.247
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:10.126 --> 01:23:12.720
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:12.895 --> 01:23:15.762
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:20.736 --> 01:23:24.263
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:30.713 --> 01:23:32.772
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:37.953 --> 01:23:42.253
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:46.695 --> 01:23:49.687
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:49.865 --> 01:23:51.992
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:11.487 --> 01:24:13.352
I love my life.


01:24:13.522 --> 01:24:15.717
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:38.180 --> 01:24:41.377
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

